# Option: WJ 1C_1D allows majors
# Description: Wspólny Język (Polish Club) rule allowing 1C/1D openings with 4-card majors.

# Wspolny Jezyk (Polish Club 1C / 1D)
OPEN 1C:
  CONVENTION: WJ_Polish_Club
  HCP: 12-21
  SHAPE: BALANCED

OPEN 1D:
  CONVENTION: WJ_Polish_Diamond
  HCP: 12-17
  LEN D: 4+
